# Generated SEO/audit output (added 2026-07-25). These are regenerated on demand
# and should not be committed. ACTION-PLAN.md is deliberately NOT ignored: it is
# tracked and hand-maintained, and a tool overwrote it once with hardcoded paths
# from the previous machine, losing 68 lines of findings.
FULL-AUDIT-REPORT.md
SEO-REPORT.html
seo-page.html
seo-report-*.html
seo-image-handoff.json
seo-image-apply-report.json

# Scratch from image-pipeline write tests
public/images/test-write.tmp

# Camera originals staged in the repo folder (added 2026-08-08). This is a PUBLIC
# repo, so an accidental `git add -A` would publish unreleased material and bloat
# history permanently — 1.5 GB of CR2/HEIC/JPG was sitting here untracked and
# unignored when this was written. Web-ready derivatives belong in public/images/;
# originals should live outside the repo entirely. These patterns are a backstop,
# not the fix.
New SH BTS Photos/
*.CR2
*.cr2
*.ARW
*.arw
*.NEF
*.nef
*.DNG
*.dng
*.HEIC
*.heic

# Per-developer agent settings. Shared agent config is CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md at the
# repo root, which stay tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json.*
